/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (1. Primary Metric: Recall \(TP / \(TP + FN\)\) In cancer screening, False Negatives are dangerous \(missing a cancer patient\). High Recall is our top priority to ensure no malignant tumor is overlooked. 2. Secondary Metric: F1-Score Since the BUSI dataset is imbalanced, accuracy can be misleading. F1-Score provides a fairer assessment of model performance on minority classes. 3. Training Monitoring: Loss & Accuracy Validation Loss: Used to monitor convergence and prevent overfitting \(via Early Stopping\). Accuracy: Provides a general overview of correct predictions across all classes.)
/E (1. Primary Metric: Recall \(TP / \(TP + FN\)\) In cancer screening, False Negatives are dangerous \(missing a cancer patient\). High Recall is our top priority to ensure no malignant tumor is overlooked. 2. Secondary Metric: F1-Score Since the BUSI dataset is imbalanced, accuracy can be misleading. F1-Score provides a fairer assessment of model performance on minority classes. 3. Training Monitoring: Loss & Accuracy Validation Loss: Used to monitor convergence and prevent overfitting \(via Early Stopping\). Accuracy: Provides a general overview of correct predictions across all classes.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
